.DS_Store

# dist/ is intentionally NOT ignored — generated marketplace.json files
# (.claude-plugin/marketplace.json and .github/plugin/marketplace.json) point
# at ./dist/<target>/<plugin>, so the dist tree must be committed for the
# marketplace to resolve plugin URLs. Run `npm run build` to regenerate.
